DATA AND LEGAL SOURCES — NOT COVERED BY THE MIT LICENCE

Lexme's legal corpus is not distributed with this repository; it is built at
run time by the `ingest` CLI from the Spanish BOE's Consolidated Legislation
open-data API. Those texts, and any answer or contract analysis derived from
them, are subject to the source's own terms of reuse:

  - Consolidated legal texts are of a "carácter meramente informativo"
    (merely informative nature) and come from the Agencia Estatal Boletín
    Oficial del Estado (BOE), https://www.boe.es. The BOE reuse licence
    requires this attribution and this notice of informative character.

Lexme provides general information, not legal advice. For a specific case,
consult a qualified professional. See the README's "License & data" section.
